{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-idioms","title":"测试惯用法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/idioms-and-best-practices/testing-idioms","wordCount":657,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试惯用法\">测试惯用法</h1><p>Kotlin 的测试生态提供了丰富的工具和惯用模式。MockK 提供原生 Kotlin 的 Mock 支持，Kotest 提供表达力强的断言和测试风格，kotlinx-coroutines-test 处理协程测试，而基于属性的测试则确保代码在各种输入下的正确性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Kotlin 测试惯用法的核心是<strong>让测试工具贴合语言本身</strong>：MockK 原生支持协程、扩展函数与对象 mock，Kotest 提供表达力强的断言与测试风格，<code>kotlinx-coroutines-test</code> 用虚拟时间驱动协程测试，基于属性的测试则用随机输入覆盖边界。选择哪种模式，取决于被测代码的协作方式与需要覆盖的失败形态。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"mockk-基础\">MockK 基础</h2><p>MockK 是专为 Kotlin 设计的 Mock 框架，原生支持协程、扩展函数和对象 mock：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import io.mockk.*&#10;&#10;interface UserRepository {&#10;    suspend fun findById(id: Long): User?&#10;    suspend fun save(user: User): User&#10;    fun count(): Int&#10;}&#10;&#10;class UserService(private val repository: UserRepository) {&#10;    suspend fun getUser(id: Long): User {&#10;        return repository.findById(id)&#10;            ?: throw NotFoundException(&quot;用户 $id 不存在&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class UserServiceTest {&#10;    private val repository = mockk&lt;UserRepository&gt;()&#10;    private val service = UserService(repository)&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `应返回已存在的用户`() = runTest {&#10;        val expectedUser = User(1, &quot;张三&quot;, &quot;zhangsan@example.com&quot;)&#10;&#10;        coEvery { repository.findById(1) } returns expectedUser&#10;&#10;        val user = service.getUser(1)&#10;&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;张三&quot;, user.name)&#10;        coVerify { repository.findById(1) }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import io.mockk.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface UserRepository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun findById(id: Long): User?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun save(user: User): User</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun count(): Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserService(private val repository: UserRepository) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getUser(id: Long): User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return repository.findById(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ?: throw NotFoundException(\"用户 $id 不存在\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserServiceTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository = mockk&#x3C;UserRepository>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val service = UserService(repository)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `应返回已存在的用户`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val expectedUser = User(1, \"张三\", \"zhangsan@example.com\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coEvery { repository.findById(1) } returns expectedUser</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val user = service.getUser(1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"张三\", user.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        coVerify { repository.findById(1) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"every-coevery\">every / coEvery</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 同步方法&#10;every { repository.count() } returns 42&#10;&#10;// 挂起方法&#10;coEvery { repository.findById(any()) } returns User(1, &quot;测试用户&quot;, &quot;test@test.com&quot;)&#10;&#10;// 根据参数返回不同值&#10;every { repository.count() } returnsMany listOf(1, 2, 3)&#10;&#10;// 抛出异常&#10;coEvery { repository.save(any()) } throws DatabaseException(&quot;连接失败&quot;)&#10;&#10;// 使用答案&#10;coEvery { repository.save(any()) } coAnswers {&#10;    firstArg&lt;User&gt;().copy(id = 100)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 同步方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>every { repository.count() } returns 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 挂起方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coEvery { repository.findById(any()) } returns User(1, \"测试用户\", \"test@test.com\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 根据参数返回不同值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>every { repository.count() } returnsMany listOf(1, 2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 抛出异常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coEvery { repository.save(any()) } throws DatabaseException(\"连接失败\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用答案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coEvery { repository.save(any()) } coAnswers {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    firstArg&#x3C;User>().copy(id = 100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"verify-coverify\">verify / coVerify</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 验证调用次数&#10;coVerify(exactly = 1) { repository.findById(1) }&#10;coVerify(atLeast = 2) { repository.save(any()) }&#10;&#10;// 验证未调用&#10;coVerify(exactly = 0) { repository.save(any()) }&#10;&#10;// 验证调用顺序&#10;coVerifyOrder {&#10;    repository.findById(1)&#10;    repository.save(any())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 验证调用次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coVerify(exactly = 1) { repository.findById(1) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coVerify(atLeast = 2) { repository.save(any()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 验证未调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coVerify(exactly = 0) { repository.save(any()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 验证调用顺序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coVerifyOrder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repository.findById(1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repository.save(any())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"slot-参数捕获\">slot 参数捕获</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Test&#10;fun `应正确保存用户`() = runTest {&#10;    val slot = slot&lt;User&gt;()&#10;    coEvery { repository.save(capture(slot)) } answers { slot.captured }&#10;&#10;    service.createUser(&quot;李四&quot;, &quot;lisi@example.com&quot;)&#10;&#10;    assertEquals(&quot;李四&quot;, slot.captured.name)&#10;    assertEquals(&quot;lisi@example.com&quot;, slot.captured.email)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun `应正确保存用户`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val slot = slot&#x3C;User>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    coEvery { repository.save(capture(slot)) } answers { slot.captured }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    service.createUser(\"李四\", \"lisi@example.com\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assertEquals(\"李四\", slot.captured.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assertEquals(\"lisi@example.com\", slot.captured.email)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[MockK 核心] --&gt; B[&quot;every/coEvery 定义行为&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;verify/coVerify 验证调用&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;slot/capture 捕获参数&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[returns / throws / answers]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;exactly / atLeast / atMost&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[MockK 核心] --&gt; B[\"every/coEvery 定义行为\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"verify/coVerify 验证调用\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"slot/capture 捕获参数\"]\n    B --&gt; E[returns / throws / answers]\n    C --&gt; F[\"exactly / atLeast / atMost\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"kotest-断言\">Kotest 断言</h2><p>Kotest 提供了丰富且可读性强的匹配器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import io.kotest.matchers.shouldBe&#10;import io.kotest.matchers.shouldNotBe&#10;import io.kotest.matchers.string.*&#10;import io.kotest.matchers.collections.*&#10;import io.kotest.matchers.maps.*&#10;&#10;@Test&#10;fun `Kotest 断言示例`() {&#10;    // 基础断言&#10;    42 shouldBe 42&#10;    &quot;hello&quot; shouldNotBe null&#10;&#10;    // 字符串断言&#10;    &quot;Kotlin&quot; shouldStartWith &quot;Kot&quot;&#10;    &quot;Kotlin&quot; shouldContain &quot;lin&quot;&#10;    &quot;Kotlin&quot; shouldHaveLength 6&#10;&#10;    // 集合断言&#10;    listOf(1, 2, 3) shouldContain 2&#10;    listOf(1, 2, 3) shouldHaveSize 3&#10;    listOf(1, 2, 3) shouldBeSorted()&#10;    listOf(1, 2, 3) shouldContainAll listOf(1, 3)&#10;&#10;    // Map 断言&#10;    mapOf(&quot;a&quot; to 1, &quot;b&quot; to 2) shouldContainKey &quot;a&quot;&#10;    mapOf(&quot;a&quot; to 1) shouldContainExactly mapOf(&quot;a&quot; to 1)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import io.kotest.matchers.shouldBe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import io.kotest.matchers.shouldNotBe</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import io.kotest.matchers.string.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import io.kotest.matchers.collections.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import io.kotest.matchers.maps.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun `Kotest 断言示例`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 基础断言</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    42 shouldBe 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"hello\" shouldNotBe null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 字符串断言</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"Kotlin\" shouldStartWith \"Kot\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"Kotlin\" shouldContain \"lin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"Kotlin\" shouldHaveLength 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 集合断言</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listOf(1, 2, 3) shouldContain 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listOf(1, 2, 3) shouldHaveSize 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listOf(1, 2, 3) shouldBeSorted()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    listOf(1, 2, 3) shouldContainAll listOf(1, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // Map 断言</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapOf(\"a\" to 1, \"b\" to 2) shouldContainKey \"a\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapOf(\"a\" to 1) shouldContainExactly mapOf(\"a\" to 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>常用匹配器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td><code>shouldBe</code>, <code>shouldNotBe</code>, <code>shouldBeNull</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td><code>shouldStartWith</code>, <code>shouldContain</code>, <code>shouldMatch</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合</td>\n<td><code>shouldContain</code>, <code>shouldHaveSize</code>, <code>shouldBeSorted</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字</td>\n<td><code>shouldBeGreaterThan</code>, <code>shouldBeInRange</code>, <code>shouldBeBetween</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常</td>\n<td><code>shouldThrow&lt;T&gt; { }</code>, <code>shouldThrowExactly&lt;T&gt; { }</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"协程测试\">协程测试</h2><p>使用 <code>kotlinx-coroutines-test</code> 提供的 <code>runTest</code> 和 <code>TestDispatcher</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlinx.coroutines.test.*&#10;&#10;class CacheServiceTest {&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `缓存过期后应重新加载`() = runTest {&#10;        val testScheduler = TestCoroutineScheduler()&#10;        val testDispatcher = StandardTestDispatcher(testScheduler)&#10;&#10;        val service = CacheService(&#10;            dispatcher = testDispatcher,&#10;            ttlMillis = 5000&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        val first = service.getData()&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;数据v1&quot;, first)&#10;&#10;        // 推进时间 6 秒&#10;        testScheduler.advanceTimeBy(6000)&#10;&#10;        val second = service.getData()&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;数据v2&quot;, second) // 缓存已过期，重新加载&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.coroutines.test.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CacheServiceTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `缓存过期后应重新加载`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val testScheduler = TestCoroutineScheduler()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val testDispatcher = StandardTestDispatcher(testScheduler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val service = CacheService(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dispatcher = testDispatcher,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ttlMillis = 5000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val first = service.getData()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"数据v1\", first)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 推进时间 6 秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        testScheduler.advanceTimeBy(6000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val second = service.getData()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"数据v2\", second) // 缓存已过期，重新加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"测试-flow\">测试 Flow</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import app.cash.turbine.test&#10;&#10;@Test&#10;fun `Flow 应按顺序发射值`() = runTest {&#10;    val viewModel = UserViewModel()&#10;&#10;    viewModel.state.test {&#10;        assertEquals(UiState.Loading, awaitItem())&#10;        assertEquals(UiState.Success(users), awaitItem())&#10;        cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import app.cash.turbine.test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun `Flow 应按顺序发射值`() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val viewModel = UserViewModel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    viewModel.state.test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(UiState.Loading, awaitItem())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(UiState.Success(users), awaitItem())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cancelAndIgnoreRemainingEvents()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Turbine 库专门用于测试 Kotlin Flow，提供了 <code>awaitItem()</code>、<code>awaitComplete()</code>、<code>awaitError()</code> 等便捷 API。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[协程测试] --&gt; B[runTest]&#10;    B --&gt; C[虚拟时间控制]&#10;    B --&gt; D[TestDispatcher]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Flow 测试]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Turbine]&#10;    F --&gt; G[awaitItem / awaitComplete]\">flowchart TD\n    A[协程测试] --&gt; B[runTest]\n    B --&gt; C[虚拟时间控制]\n    B --&gt; D[TestDispatcher]\n    A --&gt; E[Flow 测试]\n    E --&gt; F[Turbine]\n    F --&gt; G[awaitItem / awaitComplete]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"基于属性的测试\">基于属性的测试</h2><p>基于属性的测试（Property-Based Testing）自动生成大量随机输入来验证代码属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import io.kotest.property.forAll&#10;import io.kotest.property.Arb&#10;import io.kotest.property.arbitrary.*&#10;&#10;class StringUtilsTest : FunSpec({&#10;    test(&quot;反转两次应得到原字符串&quot;) {&#10;        forAll(Arb.string()) { s -&gt;&#10;            s.reversed().reversed() == s&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    test(&quot;列表排序后应有序&quot;) {&#10;        forAll(Arb.list(Arb.int())) { list -&gt;&#10;            val sorted = list.sorted()&#10;            sorted.zipWithNext().all { (a, b) -&gt; a &lt;= b }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    test(&quot;用户年龄应在有效范围内&quot;) {&#10;        val userArb = Arb.bind(&#10;            Arb.string(minSize = 1, maxSize = 50),&#10;            Arb.int(0..150)&#10;        ) { name, age -&gt; User(name, age) }&#10;&#10;        forAll(userArb) { user -&gt;&#10;            user.age in 0..150&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import io.kotest.property.forAll</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import io.kotest.property.Arb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import io.kotest.property.arbitrary.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class StringUtilsTest : FunSpec({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    test(\"反转两次应得到原字符串\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        forAll(Arb.string()) { s -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            s.reversed().reversed() == s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    test(\"列表排序后应有序\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        forAll(Arb.list(Arb.int())) { list -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val sorted = list.sorted()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            sorted.zipWithNext().all { (a, b) -> a &#x3C;= b }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    test(\"用户年龄应在有效范围内\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val userArb = Arb.bind(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Arb.string(minSize = 1, maxSize = 50),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Arb.int(0..150)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) { name, age -> User(name, age) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        forAll(userArb) { user -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            user.age in 0..150</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生成器</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Arb.string()</code></td>\n<td>随机字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arb.int(range)</code></td>\n<td>范围内的随机整数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arb.list(arb)</code></td>\n<td>随机列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arb.bind(a, b) { }</code></td>\n<td>组合多个生成器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arb.enum&lt;T&gt;()</code></td>\n<td>随机枚举值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试-fixtures\">测试 Fixtures</h2><p>结构化的测试数据管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"object TestFixtures {&#10;    fun createUser(&#10;        id: Long = 1,&#10;        name: String = &quot;测试用户&quot;,&#10;        email: String = &quot;test@example.com&quot;,&#10;        roles: List&lt;String&gt; = listOf(&quot;user&quot;)&#10;    ) = User(id, name, email, roles)&#10;&#10;    fun createOrder(&#10;        id: Long = 1,&#10;        userId: Long = 1,&#10;        items: List&lt;OrderItem&gt; = listOf(createOrderItem()),&#10;        status: OrderStatus = OrderStatus.PENDING&#10;    ) = Order(id, userId, items, status)&#10;&#10;    fun createOrderItem(&#10;        product: String = &quot;商品A&quot;,&#10;        price: Double = 99.0,&#10;        quantity: Int = 1&#10;    ) = OrderItem(product, price, quantity)&#10;}&#10;&#10;class OrderServiceTest {&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun `应计算订单总价`() {&#10;        val order = TestFixtures.createOrder(&#10;            items = listOf(&#10;                TestFixtures.createOrderItem(price = 100.0, quantity = 2),&#10;                TestFixtures.createOrderItem(price = 50.0, quantity = 3)&#10;            )&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        val total = orderService.calculateTotal(order)&#10;        total shouldBe 350.0&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>object TestFixtures {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun createUser(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        id: Long = 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        name: String = \"测试用户\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        email: String = \"test@example.com\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        roles: List&#x3C;String> = listOf(\"user\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) = User(id, name, email, roles)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun createOrder(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        id: Long = 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        userId: Long = 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items: List&#x3C;OrderItem> = listOf(createOrderItem()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        status: OrderStatus = OrderStatus.PENDING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) = Order(id, userId, items, status)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun createOrderItem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        product: String = \"商品A\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        price: Double = 99.0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        quantity: Int = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) = OrderItem(product, price, quantity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class OrderServiceTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun `应计算订单总价`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val order = TestFixtures.createOrder(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            items = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                TestFixtures.createOrderItem(price = 100.0, quantity = 2),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                TestFixtures.createOrderItem(price = 50.0, quantity = 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val total = orderService.calculateTotal(order)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        total shouldBe 350.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用带默认参数的工厂函数创建测试数据，只覆盖测试关注的字段，保持测试简洁和意图清晰。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试模式对比\">测试模式对比</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Kotlin 测试策略] --&gt; B[单元测试]&#10;    A --&gt; C[集成测试]&#10;    A --&gt; D[属性测试]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;MockK + JUnit/Kotest&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;TestContainers + Spring&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;Kotest Property Testing&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; H[快速反馈,隔离性好]&#10;    C --&gt; I[验证组件交互]&#10;    D --&gt; J[发现边界条件]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Kotlin 测试策略] --&gt; B[单元测试]\n    A --&gt; C[集成测试]\n    A --&gt; D[属性测试]\n    B --&gt; E[\"MockK + JUnit/Kotest\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"TestContainers + Spring\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"Kotest Property Testing\"]\n    B --&gt; H[快速反馈,隔离性好]\n    C --&gt; I[验证组件交互]\n    D --&gt; J[发现边界条件]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>MockK + JUnit</td>\n<td>快速、隔离</td>\n<td>业务逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断言增强</td>\n<td>Kotest Matchers</td>\n<td>可读性强</td>\n<td>所有测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协程测试</td>\n<td>coroutines-test</td>\n<td>虚拟时间</td>\n<td>异步逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flow 测试</td>\n<td>Turbine</td>\n<td>事件序列</td>\n<td>响应式流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性测试</td>\n<td>Kotest Property</td>\n<td>随机输入</td>\n<td>算法、规则</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>MockK</strong> 是 Kotlin 原生的 Mock 框架，通过 <code>every</code>/<code>coEvery</code> 定义行为，<code>verify</code>/<code>coVerify</code> 验证调用，<code>slot</code> 捕获参数</li>\n<li><strong>Kotest 匹配器</strong>提供丰富的 <code>shouldBe</code>、<code>shouldContain</code> 等断言，覆盖字符串、集合、数字等类型</li>\n<li><strong>协程测试</strong>使用 <code>runTest</code> + <code>TestDispatcher</code> 控制虚拟时间，Turbine 库测试 Flow 发射序列</li>\n<li><strong>基于属性的测试</strong>通过 <code>forAll</code> + <code>Arb</code> 生成器自动生成大量随机输入，发现边界条件和不变量</li>\n<li><strong>测试 Fixtures</strong>使用带默认参数的工厂函数管理测试数据，保持测试简洁</li>\n<li>综合使用单元测试、属性测试和集成测试构建多层次的测试策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试惯用法","id":"测试惯用法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MockK 基础","id":"mockk-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"every / coEvery","id":"every-coevery"},{"level":3,"text":"verify / coVerify","id":"verify-coverify"},{"level":3,"text":"slot 参数捕获","id":"slot-参数捕获"},{"level":2,"text":"Kotest 断言","id":"kotest-断言"},{"level":2,"text":"协程测试","id":"协程测试"},{"level":3,"text":"测试 Flow","id":"测试-flow"},{"level":2,"text":"基于属性的测试","id":"基于属性的测试"},{"level":2,"text":"测试 Fixtures","id":"测试-fixtures"},{"level":2,"text":"测试模式对比","id":"测试模式对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"序列化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/idioms-and-best-practices/serialization"},"next":null}